<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Condor Legion</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1936">1936</a>–<a href="/years/1939">1939</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Condor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/legion">Legion</a> was a unit of German air and ground forces sent by Hitler to fight for Franco's Nationalists in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spanish-civil-war">Spanish Civil War</a>. Made up mainly of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/luftwaffe">Luftwaffe</a> aircraft and crews, it gained combat experience and tested new tactics and aircraft, and its bombing of the Basque town of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guernica">Guernica</a> in April 1937 became a symbol of the horrors of modern war.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/condor-legion.jpg" alt="Condor Legion" width="320" height="235" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Condor_Legion_marching_during_the_Spanish_Civil_War.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
